# Show Interfering Parts by shells (an extension): a part linked twice
# comes in at one place both times, so the two copies share all their
# volume, which the message gives, though their faces lie on each
# other.
file $testdata/solid/chamfer-parameter.tlspr
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
file $testdata/solid/chamfer-parameter.tlspr
menu Assembly|Link / Assemble...
answer ok
menu Assembly|Show Interfering Parts
